      "lineage": {
        "description": "Height and body weight measurements for children aged 6-59 months were collected through FSNAU nutrition surveys across Somalia districts during post-Gu seasons (2017-2023). Survey data were analyzed to calculate prevalence rates of Severe Acute Malnutrition (SAM), Moderate Acute Malnutrition (MAM), and Global Acute Malnutrition (GAM), with results classified using IPC AMN standards to assess nutrition emergency severity by district.",
